-- ownership: a model 256 parts wide, one message per part, each arm
-- `{ model | pᵢ = bump model.pᵢ }` (#716). Each arm's value holds the other
-- 255 parts (§31.3's closed split), each demand has `model` as its holder, and
-- the entry asks of each part's write whether the model's other parts reach
-- it (§20.6). Each is the model's width once, not its square: the report costs
-- 2 517M instructions on the safe build where it cost 4 438M. Every update is
-- accepted, and every entry line is `platform`.
import Browser
import Html exposing (Html)
import Tea


